  "info": {
    "title": "MICROSERVICE_DEV_SIM Swap Management API",
    "description": "The SIM Swap Management API facilitates the seamless processing of SIM card swaps for telecommunications providers. This API allows vendors to initiate the replacement of SIM cards when users require changes such as upgrading or transferring their services. It serves as a critical tool for customer service representatives and automated systems handling user requests. Typical consumers include telecommunication support teams and mobile service management platforms, enhancing operational efficiency and customer satisfaction.",
